# Cart & checkout handoff

## Client cart (Next.js)

Each line item must include: `productId`, `variationId`, `quantity`, `price`.
Persist via Context + `useEffect` ↔ `localStorage` so refreshes keep the cart.

## Handoff URL (blueprint §5)

Redirect to WooCommerce with:

`{CHECKOUT_URL}/?add-to-cart-custom=parent_id:variation_id:quantity,...`

Use `buildCheckoutHandoffUrl` from `@/lib/cart/handoff`. Do not invent alternate multi-cart plugins or query shapes.

## WordPress side (reference only)

See `.cursor/rules/wordpress-php.mdc` (blueprint §5). Keep the Next.js query payload compatible with that PHP contract.
